  "mpvPerformanceWarningTitle": "Performance notice",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningDebandMedium": "Medium debanding adds extra picture processing overhead; some devices may drop frames, heat up or stutter.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningSharpen": "Sharpening adds filter computation; on heavy sources or weaker devices it can cause dropped frames and a choppy UI.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningDenoise": "Denoising is a heavy video filter and can easily cause obvious frame drops, heat and even system stutter on mobile devices.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningDeinterlaceForce": "Forced deinterlacing sends every source through extra processing; it's usually unnecessary for progressive sources and may slow playback.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningScaleQuality": "High-quality scaling adds GPU and rendering load; frame drops are more likely on high-resolution or high-bitrate sources.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningHdr": "This HDR mode adds tone mapping load and can cause noticeable stutter on HDR, 10-bit or high-resolution sources.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningFrameInterpolation": "Frame interpolation is one of the options most likely to slow playback and system smoothness; enabling it may cause video frame drops, UI frame drops and system stutter.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningVideoSyncSmooth": "Smooth sync tracks the screen refresh rate more aggressively and adds compositing and sync overhead on some devices.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningCacheNetwork": "Heavy network caching uses more memory and makes refill after seeking heavier; only recommended for high-bitrate remote sources.",
  "mpvPerformanceWarningCacheSize": "Larger buffers use more memory and make startup and refill after seeking heavier; on low-memory devices this may hurt system smoothness.",
